  m_text: "Welcome!\n\r\nYou\u2019re about to take part in a study about\nhow automatic
    vehicle (AV) behave at crosswalks.\n\r\n\u2022 Before each trial, a green ball
    will appear on your right.\r\n\u2022 Click it when you're ready to begin.\r\n\u2022
    Four cars will pass in front of you.\r\n\u2022 Then, the target AV will approach.\r\n\u2022
    Your task: cross the street when you feel it\u2019s safe.\n\nPlease use the trigger
    on your controller to proceed.\n\r\r\r\r\r"
